= 31 July 1974 — Local advances after Geneva

“Turkish forces advanced approximately 1000 metres west from Ayios Ermolaos … approximately 500 metres south from a point near the Nicosia race course”

[S/11353/Add.12, paragraph 2 — UN report excerpt.](https://digitallibrary.un.org/record/484532/files/S_11353_Add.12-EN.pdf)


- @historical: Continue limited advances around Şirinevler and the western Lefkoşa approaches.
- @alternative: Hold the Geneva positions and request UN verification of opposing withdrawals.

